  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping of Ex-Associates in Communities in Far North Region of Cameroon for Strengthened DDR Programming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to increase the level of information available on the location and key characteristics of ex-associates of armed groups living within communities in Far North region, so that strategies for the implementation of disarmament, demobilization and reintegration (DDR) and DDR-related activities can improved for overall greater impact.</narrative>
  </description>
